# tape's lines by kind and first verse (tape_kind, tape_verse) or the kin's cells by CALL (cell, cell_found), never a second write; T2 SUPPLIED WITH A WRITE, TWICE (10:2 the fragments,
# 10:6 the burial — the two retrograde lines and their statuses); T6 ONE stretch row (10:10 — the third forty between the second ascent's marker and the timers' fire: the resolver takes a
